1
00:00:00,221 --> 00:00:03,511
(Sheldon:)...I've co-authored two papers
in notable peer-reviewed journals...

2
00:00:03,683 --> 00:00:06,933
(Sheldon:)...and I'm close to figuring out
why the Large Hadron Collider...

3
00:00:07,103 --> 00:00:09,643
(Sheldon:)...has yet to isolate
the Higgs boson particle.

4
00:00:09,981 --> 00:00:14,401
(Leonard:)You left out, got chafed testicles
because you no longer wear underpants.

5
00:00:17,739 --> 00:00:20,279
(Sheldon:)The dice giveth
and the dice taketh away.

6
00:00:22,202 --> 00:00:26,082
- ls Raj out with Emily again?
- Yeah. Every night for the last month.

7
00:00:26,247 --> 00:00:27,997
Wow. I can't believe he has a girIfriend.

8
00:00:29,793 --> 00:00:31,423
(Sheldon(rolls dice):)Me neither.

9
00:00:33,129 --> 00:00:35,759
(Howard:)Here's some other fun news
on the Raj-Emily front.

10
00:00:35,924 --> 00:00:39,214
(Howard:)He gave her a pair of diamond earrings
and leased her a car.

11
00:00:39,427 --> 00:00:40,847
(Penny:)You're kidding.

12
00:00:41,012 --> 00:00:43,512
(Leonard:)- Think she's taking advantage of him?
- Oh, of course not.

13
00:00:43,682 --> 00:00:47,102
(Penny:)She wouldn't do something like that.
She's deaf.

14
00:00:50,146 --> 00:00:52,236
(Leonard:)Deaf women can't be gold diggers?

15
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:56,440
(Penny:)Handicapped people are nice, Leonard.
Everyone knows that.

16
00:00:57,862 --> 00:01:07,022
(Sheldon:)I actually have information about Raj that
would be helpful with this discussion.

